   238	The auxiliary `l_0=0` is legitimate: §4 needs only pair sums `l_i+l_j != 0`, not nonzero individual transverse parameters. It is a background device, not an illicit additional generic soliton.
   239	
   240	By the charge counting just proved,
   241	
   242	`Fhat=F0+u*Fplus`, `Ghat=G0+u^(-1)*Gminus`.
