     7	**SOLVED for the precise all-N construction statement by a complete written algebraic proof**, subject to the independent-review disposition in [RESULTS.md](RESULTS.md). FRONTIER: **NOVELTY-UNCLEAR**. Evidence label: **Certification**, not Discovery. No claim of a new integrable model, scientific priority, or Lean/kernel certification is made.
     8	
