    48	
    49	The sibling `phys-bilinear-higher-dim-integrability/RESULTS.md` C3/C6 had established all eight mixed-parity three-soliton patterns and exact finite N=4,5 controls, but no closed mixed formula or all-N argument. Those facts were only the local starting baseline, not evidence of scientific priority.
